 72: [style: very good analysis][very_good_analysis_link]
 73: [License: MIT][license_link]
 74: 
 75: Generated by the [Very Good CLI][very_good_cli_link] 🤖
 76: 
 77: AI Desktop Assistant for Visually Impaired
 78: 
 79: ---
 80: 
 81: ## Getting Started 🚀
 82: 
 83: This project contains 3 flavors:
 84: 
 85: - development
 86: - staging
 87: - production
 88: 
 89: To run the desired flavor either use the launch configuration in VSCode/Android Studio or use the following commands:
 90: 
 91: ```sh
 92: # Development
 93: $ flutter run --flavor development --target lib/main_development.dart
 94: 
 95: # Staging
 96: $ flutter run --flavor staging --target lib/main_staging.dart
 97: 
 98: # Production
 99: $ flutter run --flavor production --target lib/main_production.dart
100: ```
101: 
